   "pages": [
    {
     "page_no": 1,
     "heading": "",
     "text": "SINTETIK - CONTOH SAHAJA / SYNTHETIC - SAMPLE ONLY\n\n# GUIDELINE NO. 2 OF 2025 (GARIS PANDUAN BIL. 2/2025)\n\nTitle: Cloud-First Guideline 2025\nIssued by: Pejabat Ketua Pegawai Digital Contoh (Sintetik)\nReference: GP 2/2025\nDate issued: 15 January 2025\nEffective date: 1 February 2025\nClassification: TERBUKA"
    },
    {
     "page_no": 2,
     "heading": "PURPOSE",
     "text": "## PURPOSE\n\n1. This guideline makes cloud the first choice for new government systems while keeping the most sensitive information on-premise."
    },
    {
     "page_no": 3,
     "heading": "SCOPE",
     "text": "## SCOPE\n\n2. This guideline applies to all federal ministries, departments and agencies, and to their ICT vendors."
    },
    {
     "page_no": 4,
     "heading": "CLOUD USE BY CLASSIFICATION",
     "text": "## CLOUD USE BY CLASSIFICATION\n\n3. Where information may be stored depends on its security classification:\n\n3.1 Information classified Terbuka may be stored in any approved cloud service.\n\n3.2 Information classified Terhad may be stored in approved in-country cloud regions with the approval of the Chief Digital Officer.\n\n3.3 Information classified Sulit may be stored in approved in-country cloud regions only if it is encrypted with keys held by the Government.\n\n3.4 Information classified Rahsia or Rahsia Besar must remain on-premise in the Government Data Centre."
    },
    {
     "page_no": 5,
     "heading": "APPROVAL PROCESS",
     "text": "## APPROVAL PROCESS\n\n4. Agencies submit the Cloud Use Application Form to the Chief Digital Officer, who decides within 14 working days of receiving a complete application."
    },
    {
     "page_no": 6,
     "heading": "SUPERSESSION",
     "text": "## SUPERSESSION\n\n5. This guideline supersedes the Guideline on the Use of Public Cloud Services, Garis Panduan Bil. 1/2022, with effect from 1 February 2025."
    },
    {
     "page_no": 7,
     "heading": "EFFECTIVE DATE",
     "text": "## EFFECTIVE DATE\n\n6. This guideline takes effect on 1 February 2025.\n\n---\nSINTETIK - CONTOH SAHAJA / SYNTHETIC - SAMPLE ONLY"
    }
   ],
